वि-√ मथ् (or -मन्थ्) P. Ā. -मथति, ˚ते, -मथ्नाति, ˚नीते &c. (in Veda generally Ā.; inf. -मथितोस्, AitBr.; ˚तुम्, BhP.),
to tear off, snatch away, TS.; ŚBr.;
to tear or break in pieces, rend asunder, bruise, ib.; AitBr.; Kāṭh.;
to cut in pieces, disperse, scatter, MBh.; R.;
to confuse, perplex, bewilder, BhP.

वि-√ मथ् (or -मन्थ्) P. Ā. -मथति, ˚ते, -मथ्नाति, ˚नीते &c. (in Veda generally Ā.; inf. -मथितोस्, AitBr.; ˚तुम्, BhP.),
to tear off, snatch away, TS.; ŚBr.;
to tear or break in pieces, rend asunder, bruise, ib.; AitBr.; Kāṭh.;
to cut in pieces, disperse, scatter, MBh.; R.;
to confuse, perplex, bewilder, BhP.

1. वि-√ मद् P. -माद्यति (Ved. also -मदति), to be joyful or merry (only p. -म॑दत्), AV.;
to become perplexed or discomposed, AitBr.;
to confound, embarrass, disturb, ŚāṅkhBr. : Caus. (only aor. व्य्-अमीमदम्),
to confuse, perplex, bewilder, AV.

वि-√ 3. मा P. Ā. -माति, -मिमीते, to measure, mete out, pass over, traverse, RV.; Br.; Kauś.;
to enumerate, BhP.;
to ordain, fix, set right, arrange, make ready, prepare, RV.

1. वि-√ मुच् P. Ā. -मुञ्चति, ˚ते (Impv. -मुमोक्तु, RV. i, 24, 13), to unloose, unharness (Ā. ‘one's own horses’), unyoke (i.e. ‘make to halt, cause to stop or rest’), RV. &c. &c.;
to take off (clothes, ornaments &c.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to release, set free, liberate, ib.;
to leave, abandon, quit, desert, give up, relinquish, ib.;
to shun, avoid, MuṇḍUp.; Bhag. &c.;
to lose (consciousness), Hariv.;
to pardon, forgive, Gīt.; BhP.;
to emit, discharge, shed, pour or send forth, MBh.; R.; Pañcat. (with ग्रस्तम्, to set free a seized planet i.e. ‘free it from eclipse’, Sūryas.);
to throw, hurl, cast (with आत्मानम् and loc., ‘to cast one's self into’, Uttarar.), MBh.; R. &c.;
to utter (a sound), MBh.;
to assume (a shape), Mn. i, 56;
to lay (eggs), Pañcat. i, 353/354;
 Pass. -मुच्यते, to be unloosed or detached &c.;
to be slackened (as reins), Śak.;
to drop or be expelled (prematurely, as a fetus), Suśr.;
to be freed or delivered or released (esp. from the bonds of existence), get rid of, escape from (abl. adv. in -तस्, gen., or instr.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to be deprived of (instr.), Hit. :
Caus. -मोचयति, to loosen, detach, Śak.;
to unyoke, Kauś.;
to set free, deliver from (abl.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to keep off, avoid, R. :
Desid. -मुमुक्षति, ˚ते, to wish to liberate (Ā. ‘one's self’), BhP.

वि-√ मुह् P. Ā.;
 -मुह्यति, ˚ते, to be confused, become bewildered or stupefied, faint away, Yājñ.; MBh. &c. :
Caus. -मोहयति, to confuse, bewilder, infatuate, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to confound, efface, Sāy.

वि-√ मृज् P. Ā. -मार्ष्टि, -मृष्टे (pf. Pot. -मामृजीत, RV.), to rub off or out, purify, cleanse, Br.; ŚrS.;
to rub dry, TS.;
to rub on or in, anoint, smear with (instr.), GṛŚrS.;
to wipe off, MBh.; Mṛcch.;
to rub, stroke, caress, MBh.; R. &c.;
 Ā. (with तन्व॑म्), to adorn or arm one's self, RV. vii, 95, 3.

वि-√ मृद् P. -मृद्नाति, -मर्दति, to crush or press to pieces, bruise, pound, grind down, lay waste, destroy, Mn.; MBh. &c. ;
to rub together, Suśr. :
Caus. -मर्दयति, to crush to pieces, bruise, Kāv.; Pur.;
to rub, Suśr.

वि-√ मृश् (often confounded with वि-√ मृष्) P. -मृशति, to touch (with the hands), stroke, feel, MBh.; R.;
to touch (mentally), be sensible or aware of, perceive, consider, reflect on, deliberate about, RV. &c. &c.;
to investigate, examine, try, test, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 (with inf.) to hesitate about doing anything, Sāh. :
Caus. -मर्शयति, to ponder, reflect on, consider, Kāv.; Pañcat.; BhP.
